WEBVTT

01:31.136 --> 01:33.824
[Episode 7]

01:37.319 --> 01:40.239
The Imperial Exam fraud
is the fault of the Ministry of Rites.

01:40.239 --> 01:42.640
My mistake caused you to suffer.

01:43.480 --> 01:44.640
If you truly wish to repay me,

01:45.683 --> 01:49.599
then take good care of yourself
and prepare well for the exam.

01:49.599 --> 01:54.560
I remember when we were in Shazhou,
you gave me a chance,

01:54.560 --> 01:57.439
but I refused your kind offer.

01:57.439 --> 01:58.799
Now I understand.

01:59.599 --> 02:04.680
In this cruel world,
holding onto lofty ideals can be fatal.

02:05.519 --> 02:07.000
I'm afraid

02:07.000 --> 02:11.240
that one day, even you couldn't protect me.

02:12.960 --> 02:15.000
I still remember
the Meng Ting Hui from Shazhou.

02:15.919 --> 02:17.840
She was full of high spirits
and grand strategies.

02:18.680 --> 02:22.439
Her Huiyuan policy essay was even sharper,
and she had even greater ambition.

02:25.840 --> 02:29.639
Now that I am by your side,
you don't need to live in fear.

02:31.719 --> 02:34.080
I look forward to you
holding the reins of power,

02:34.080 --> 02:37.479
serving the court
and bringing prosperity to the people.

02:44.879 --> 02:47.719
Do you really believe I can do it?

02:49.319 --> 02:50.319
I believe

02:56.000 --> 02:58.800
Meng Ting Hui who debated state affairs
with me in Shazhou.

03:01.719 --> 03:04.000
Then can I still call you He Du?

03:34.560 --> 03:37.680
<i>Fu Zhi, I must seize power,</i>

03:38.680 --> 03:42.199
<i>so that I can protect you and avenge myself.</i>

03:43.680 --> 03:45.919
<i>But my own strength alone
is too insignificant.</i>

03:46.960 --> 03:48.199
<i>If I want to stay in the capital,</i>

03:48.879 --> 03:52.520
<i>I must use my friendship with He Du
to get closer to him.</i>

03:53.639 --> 03:56.919
<i>But the Emperor's mind is unfathomable,
and my future remains uncertain.</i>

03:58.759 --> 04:02.639
<i>While recovering in the palace,
I will prepare for the Palace Exam.</i>

04:03.879 --> 04:06.400
<i>I miss you. Don't worry about me.</i>

04:12.704 --> 04:15.479
[Chaoxin Garden]

04:15.479 --> 04:18.399
So Miss Meng and His Majesty
have such a history.

04:19.040 --> 04:22.279
No wonder His Majesty insisted on
bringing her back for treatment despite objections.

04:22.279 --> 04:23.519
What are you so envious of?

04:23.519 --> 04:25.120
Do you also dream
of winning a beauty's heart?

04:25.120 --> 04:27.160
- You!
- Nian, Zhi Shu.

04:27.160 --> 04:28.160
What are you talking about?

04:28.160 --> 04:29.759
Nian is yearning for love.

04:29.759 --> 04:30.839
Nonsense!

04:30.839 --> 04:32.399
Then why are you so worked up?

04:34.480 --> 04:36.639
Nian, you've grown up.

04:36.639 --> 04:38.959
Which girl has caught your eye?
Tell me, and I will go ask

04:38.959 --> 04:40.839
Father and Mother
propose the marriage for you.

04:40.839 --> 04:43.839
I spend all day in the military camp.
How could any girl catch my eyes?

04:44.600 --> 04:47.920
But you've been in the palace for many days.

04:47.920 --> 04:49.639
Mother and I are missing you.

04:51.399 --> 04:53.240
Miss Meng has now fully recovered,

04:53.240 --> 04:54.759
so I don't need to stay with her today.

04:55.959 --> 04:59.120
Zhi Li, His Majesty and Miss Meng
encountered in Shazhou.

04:59.120 --> 05:00.240
They share a life-and-death bond.

05:00.240 --> 05:02.240
That's why His Majesty
takes special care of her.

05:03.000 --> 05:04.759
I know all this.

05:04.759 --> 05:05.759
What do you mean by that?

05:07.759 --> 05:09.519
We grew up with His Majesty since childhood.

05:09.519 --> 05:11.079
He takes special care of you as well.

05:11.079 --> 05:12.920
Now that he's reached the age
to choose an Empress.

05:12.920 --> 05:15.199
Don't you want to be the Empress?

05:16.519 --> 05:18.879
You! Shen Zhi Shu!

05:18.879 --> 05:20.720
What's wrong with you?

05:20.720 --> 05:23.800
His Majesty and I are not real siblings,
but we are closer than that.

05:26.759 --> 05:29.079
Just like Nian and me,
we'll always be brother and sister.

05:29.680 --> 05:32.560
It seems I couldn't be the Empress's brother.

05:34.079 --> 05:36.959
Zhi Li, you've been working hard these days.

05:36.959 --> 05:39.879
Today I can go home early
and make your favorite lotus leaf chicken.

05:40.560 --> 05:42.560
No need. I have to go see Master first.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.680
I might return late.

05:43.680 --> 05:45.600
Tell Mother for me. I'm leaving.

05:47.879 --> 05:49.720
I wonder
what's so interesting about that old man.

05:49.720 --> 05:51.879
He's so bookish.
Only Zhi Li likes to listen to him.

05:53.120 --> 05:54.879
What about you? You happen to be free today,

05:54.879 --> 05:56.519
and I haven't had
lotus leaf chicken in a long time.

05:56.519 --> 05:57.600
I'll try your cooking.

05:58.240 --> 06:01.279
I have official duties to do.
Go eat it by yourself.

06:01.279 --> 06:02.432
I won't be back until tomorrow morning.

06:04.399 --> 06:06.439
You two have passed the Metropolitan Exam.

06:06.439 --> 06:08.560
I have prepared a gift for you.

06:08.560 --> 06:10.879
I hope you achieve excellent results
in the Palace Exam.

06:13.720 --> 06:15.600
It's the Four Treasures of the Study
from Shanlian House.

06:15.600 --> 06:17.759
This Hu brush and Hui inkstick
are both of top quality.

06:20.399 --> 06:21.440
Thank you, Master.

06:24.000 --> 06:25.088
Zhi Li.

06:34.160 --> 06:37.000
This is a seal Master carved for Zhi Li?

06:37.000 --> 06:39.319
Seal carving takes many days.

06:39.319 --> 06:41.720
Did you finish it
before the Metropolitan Exam?

06:43.399 --> 06:45.040
Were you not afraid I wouldn't pass?

06:46.319 --> 06:47.360
I trust you.

06:48.199 --> 06:50.720
You have outstanding talent
and unique insight.

06:50.720 --> 06:53.079
The court needs people of vision like you.

06:54.639 --> 06:57.120
Thank you. I will treasure it.

06:59.360 --> 07:00.544
Honey.

07:03.279 --> 07:04.279
Greetings, Madam.

07:07.480 --> 07:09.720
Since my husband is
celebrating his students' success today,

07:09.720 --> 07:12.839
as his wife, I should also come
to offer my congratulations.

07:14.000 --> 07:17.079
Zhi Li, do you like the seal?

07:17.079 --> 07:19.319
He carved it for days,

07:19.319 --> 07:20.959
making his eyes sore badly.

07:20.959 --> 07:23.120
I had to massage them every day
just to help him see clearly.

07:24.160 --> 07:27.720
This seal is a small gift from both of us.

07:32.240 --> 07:33.319
Thank you for your kindness, Madam.

07:34.439 --> 07:37.720
Honey, you must take good care of yourself,

07:37.720 --> 07:39.879
or else I couldn't rest well either.

07:40.680 --> 07:43.319
You two truly share a deep, loving bond.

07:43.319 --> 07:44.639
It makes us quite envious.

07:45.360 --> 07:47.680
You will all start your own families.

07:48.759 --> 07:50.959
My husband instructs you in your studies,

07:50.959 --> 07:54.319
and I could help you
navigate the important matters of life.

07:56.319 --> 07:57.639
Especially you, Zhi Li.

07:58.600 --> 08:01.160
If there's someone you like,
you must tell me.

08:03.720 --> 08:04.832
Thank you, Madam.

08:06.199 --> 08:08.279
Alright, I have matters to attend to.

08:08.279 --> 08:09.312
You may go back now.

08:10.560 --> 08:11.800
We take our leave.

08:20.839 --> 08:24.839
At home, you won't even
bother to bring a cup of tea.

08:24.839 --> 08:26.839
Yet today, you carved a seal for someone.

08:26.839 --> 08:27.879
Aren't you afraid of hurting your hands?

08:29.879 --> 08:31.240
Look at you.

08:31.920 --> 08:34.279
Is there a trace
of the noble lady you once were?

08:34.279 --> 08:36.559
Are you saying I'm not as young
and beautiful as I used to be?

08:36.559 --> 08:37.840
You are the one who changed first.

08:37.840 --> 08:40.799
Enough.
I have official business to attend to.

08:42.799 --> 08:45.960
Dou Kou, look at him.
He's getting more and more impatient with me.

08:53.960 --> 08:58.000
Everyone, guess what this is.

08:58.000 --> 09:04.080
This is the legendary Pearl Whitening Powder
that makes one adorable and likable.

09:04.080 --> 09:05.639
Pearl Whitening Powder!

09:05.639 --> 09:09.559
Hua Rong, last time you told me
you wanted to be prettier and fair-skinned.

09:09.559 --> 09:12.159
After I went back,
I pondered it day and night,

09:12.159 --> 09:14.320
working hard
and even skipping meals and sleep.

09:14.320 --> 09:18.799
And I finally developed
this exclusive balm just for you.

09:22.039 --> 09:23.679
Apply it twice daily
in the morning and evening.

09:23.679 --> 09:24.840
And I guarantee your face

09:24.840 --> 09:26.879
will become smooth, flawless,

09:26.879 --> 09:27.879
and delicate.

09:27.879 --> 09:30.624
Everyone will adore and like you.

09:30.624 --> 09:31.720
- I want one too.
- Me too.

09:31.720 --> 09:34.279
I have enough for everyone. Take it easy.

09:34.279 --> 09:36.759
I have enough for everyone.

09:38.320 --> 09:40.480
Pharmacist Yin,
you have quite a leisurely job.

09:40.480 --> 09:41.919
You come to our place
whenever you have free time.

09:41.919 --> 09:44.960
If someone finds out,
you'll surely get a beating.

09:45.720 --> 09:46.840
It's a good thing.

09:46.840 --> 09:49.360
Otherwise, he wouldn't have time
to make balms and powders for us.

09:49.360 --> 09:50.919
- Exactly!
- Right!

09:50.919 --> 09:54.759
So, everyone, feel free to buy more.

09:54.759 --> 09:58.639
Next up is the last balm of the day,

09:58.639 --> 10:00.120
Magnolia Balm.

10:01.240 --> 10:02.279
Apply it all over your body every night,

10:02.279 --> 10:05.440
and I guarantee you'll wake up
smelling fragrant and with beautiful skin.

10:05.440 --> 10:07.039
It only costs five taels.

10:07.039 --> 10:09.799
It costed three taels the day before.
Why does it cost five taels now?

10:09.799 --> 10:14.440
Is it expensive? Five taels
can make you beautiful and fragrant.

10:14.440 --> 10:16.440
You can have a good mood every single day.

10:16.440 --> 10:18.519
Do you think
you're just buying the Magnolia Balm?

10:18.519 --> 10:22.159
No! You're fighting for beauty.

10:23.080 --> 10:25.000
Come here. Let me tell you a secret.

10:25.960 --> 10:28.759
Do you know Miss Meng,
who's been staying in the palace these days?

10:29.840 --> 10:32.879
Even she is a regular customer
of my Magnolia Balm.

10:32.879 --> 10:36.440
Otherwise, she couldn't
stay in the palace for so long.

10:37.080 --> 10:39.039
You know what I mean. I couldn't say more.

10:41.519 --> 10:42.879
Just buy it.

10:42.879 --> 10:44.120
- I want one.
- Me too.

10:44.120 --> 10:45.720
I have enough for everyone.

10:45.720 --> 10:47.879
Here. This is yours.

10:47.879 --> 10:48.960
- Give it to me first.
- It's mine.

10:51.799 --> 10:55.120
Next time,
I'll make exclusive balms just for you all.

10:55.120 --> 10:56.160
Okay!

10:57.399 --> 10:59.440
This smells so good.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.759
It smells so good.

11:01.559 --> 11:02.679
- Let's go.
- Good.

11:05.600 --> 11:09.000
Miss, you look unfamiliar.

11:09.000 --> 11:11.759
I have the Pearl Whitening Powder here
that makes one adorable and likable.

11:11.759 --> 11:12.768
Would you like one?

11:14.360 --> 11:16.120
Is Miss Meng really your regular customer?

11:21.080 --> 11:24.000
That's a secret between Miss Meng and me.

11:25.000 --> 11:28.000
Miss Meng is a regular buyer
of my Pearl Whitening Powder.

11:28.000 --> 11:29.360
Even His Majesty uses it.

11:29.360 --> 11:31.840
Miss Meng bought it for His Majesty.

11:31.840 --> 11:35.360
She begged me for a long time
before I agreed to sell it to her.

11:37.440 --> 11:40.279
Then I'll buy what Miss Meng bought.

11:42.000 --> 11:43.279
This is the last one.

11:43.279 --> 11:46.679
You are smart,
willing to pay for your own beauty.

11:46.679 --> 11:48.679
Fixed price, twenty taels.

11:50.120 --> 11:53.360
The price isn't
what you just charged those ladies.

11:54.639 --> 11:56.000
A thing is priced high if it is rare.

11:56.000 --> 11:58.799
This is the last bottle. Buy it now,

11:58.799 --> 12:00.519
then you can become more beautiful

12:00.519 --> 12:02.960
and meet your ideal husband soon.

12:05.960 --> 12:07.960
I'm about the same age as you.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.480
No need to flatter me.

12:10.159 --> 12:13.240
I didn't bring any taels.
Come with me to get them.

12:13.240 --> 12:15.600
Let me tell you, Miss Meng always praises me.

12:16.840 --> 12:17.879
I'll go back and try it.

12:20.440 --> 12:24.919
Miss, I just remembered
I have some urgent business.

12:24.919 --> 12:27.559
You can pay me later. I'll be going now.

12:27.559 --> 12:30.360
Miss Meng, what are you doing here?

12:31.559 --> 12:34.840
Miss Meng? I'll be leaving now.

12:35.480 --> 12:38.000
Lord, I caught a swindler.

12:38.000 --> 12:41.879
He sold overpriced cosmetics
to the palace ladies. Please deal with him.

12:41.879 --> 12:44.320
It's a misunderstanding.
It's all a misunderstanding.

12:44.320 --> 12:48.600
Miss Meng,
if you like anything in my bag, just take it.

12:50.840 --> 12:52.039
Thank you.

12:52.039 --> 12:53.056
You're welcome.

12:54.600 --> 12:56.120
We are acquaintances. I'll see her off.

12:58.399 --> 13:00.840
Well, it's you again.

13:00.840 --> 13:02.039
Flog him five times.

13:02.960 --> 13:04.960
It's a misunderstanding.

13:06.159 --> 13:07.919
It's a misunderstanding, Captain Di.

13:07.919 --> 13:10.559
Do you need
any of that Pearl Whitening Powder?

13:10.559 --> 13:11.799
How about giving you for free forever?

13:16.200 --> 13:18.799
Lord Xu, you claim to respect me,

13:20.559 --> 13:23.919
yet you abolished the Imperial Exam for Women
before reporting to me.

13:23.919 --> 13:28.679
Has the court become a place
where only your voice is heard?

13:28.679 --> 13:29.840
Please calm your anger, Your Majesty.

13:30.600 --> 13:35.039
I speak for the Six Ministries
and hundreds of Ning Empire's officials.

13:35.039 --> 13:39.360
This exam fraud
has thrown the capital into chaos.

13:39.360 --> 13:41.399
The Laws of Ning Empire clearly states

13:41.399 --> 13:45.639
that the chief examiner has the authority
to abolish the exam due to major fraud.

13:46.879 --> 13:49.480
I was merely acting according to the law.

13:49.480 --> 13:51.679
Well said.

13:51.679 --> 13:57.399
The late Emperor granted you this dragon staff
to assist me, not to govern in my stead.

13:57.399 --> 14:00.279
I have a clear conscience.

14:00.279 --> 14:02.360
When you were still the Crown Prince,

14:02.360 --> 14:05.120
you studied the "Model of the Emperor" at eight
and learned how to govern the nation at twelve.

14:05.120 --> 14:08.000
I taught you wholeheartedly.

14:08.000 --> 14:12.559
Everything I do now
is for you and for the court,

14:12.559 --> 14:14.279
without the slightest selfish motive.

14:14.279 --> 14:17.759
I've had enough of your rhetoric.

14:17.759 --> 14:20.039
I wanted to reform the grain transport system,
and you called it risky.

14:20.039 --> 14:22.120
I wanted to reorganize the Imperial Guard,
and you called it radical.

14:22.120 --> 14:25.519
Now I want to establish the Imperial Exam,
and you forcibly abolished it.

14:29.240 --> 14:33.159
In your eyes, are all my decisions wrong?

14:41.279 --> 14:45.039
Your Majesty, when you were the Crown Prince,

14:45.039 --> 14:47.759
I taught you

14:47.759 --> 14:50.720
that a ruler must have his own opinions.

14:50.720 --> 14:53.320
Now that you truly have your own opinions,

14:54.080 --> 14:56.159
you despise me instead.

14:56.159 --> 14:59.279
By defending
the Imperial Exam for Women this time,

14:59.279 --> 15:03.960
do you really think
I am too old and incompetent to assist you?

15:03.960 --> 15:08.399
What the Ning Empire needs is never a ruler
who merely maintains the conventions.

15:10.039 --> 15:12.200
Lord Xu, you should have let go long ago.

15:17.960 --> 15:20.879
It was precisely because
I let go for a moment

15:21.799 --> 15:24.679
that the Imperial Exam for Women
became a mess.

15:26.639 --> 15:29.559
Today, I insist on being
a disobedient minister.

15:29.559 --> 15:32.919
As long as I have this dragon staff,

15:33.799 --> 15:36.960
the Imperial Exam for Women
must be abolished.

15:36.960 --> 15:38.519
I second.

15:45.600 --> 15:53.376
[Permanently Abolish
the Imperial Exam for Women]

15:55.799 --> 15:57.399
In the half year since I ascended the throne,

15:57.399 --> 15:59.840
the nation is stable
and everything is renewed.

16:00.840 --> 16:03.879
I now establish the Imperial Exam for Women
to select talent based solely on merit.

16:05.279 --> 16:06.399
Father, Mother.

16:07.080 --> 16:09.720
Lord Xu has dominated
the court for many years.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.639
Key positions in the Six Ministries
are all filled by members of his faction.

16:12.879 --> 16:17.159
Though I have inherited the throne,
my decrees struggle to be executed.

16:18.440 --> 16:22.112
This time, disregarding all objections,
I am restarting the Imperial Exam for Women,

16:23.120 --> 16:26.624
using it as a sword to break this stalemate.

16:27.712 --> 16:31.552
[Imperial Library]

16:35.120 --> 16:39.159
Everyone, His Majesty is approaching.
Please leave immediately.

17:04.440 --> 17:06.680
[Laws of Ning Empire]
Are you looking for the Laws of Ning Empire?

17:15.440 --> 17:17.680
So audacious, Meng Ting Hui!

17:17.680 --> 17:19.200
How dare you to trespass
in the Imperial Library

17:19.200 --> 17:22.279
and hide here when Chief Steward You
dismissed everyone else?

17:22.279 --> 17:26.160
I've heard this place holds vast knowledge.
Today, I am here to see it with my own eyes.

17:26.160 --> 17:28.599
Since no one stopped me,
how can it be trespassing?

17:28.599 --> 17:32.480
Besides, I was reading in the corner
and didn't see Chief Steward You.

17:32.480 --> 17:35.319
With the Imperial Exam for Women abolished,
what are you still reading for?

17:35.319 --> 17:37.759
I think you aren't truly willing
to abolish the exam.

17:37.759 --> 17:41.200
Naturally, I must follow your decree
and prepare for the exam well,

17:41.200 --> 17:43.160
instead of following the order of Lord Xu.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.799
Smooth talker.

17:45.440 --> 17:47.160
It seems you have recovered.

17:47.160 --> 17:49.680
Your weak physique
from days ago is also gone.

17:49.680 --> 17:53.480
I was physically and mentally exhausted,
and drank too much back then.

17:54.359 --> 17:56.599
It's true that I lost my composure.

17:56.599 --> 18:01.240
But the courage I shared with He Du
when facing life and death is also true.

18:01.240 --> 18:04.400
I wonder which side of me you prefer.

18:07.920 --> 18:11.920
Those selected for the Imperial Exam
must withstand scrutiny in every aspect.

18:11.920 --> 18:17.400
I think He Du in Shazhou
was more interesting than you are now.

18:22.680 --> 18:26.400
Do you know
I hate being schemed against most?

18:27.200 --> 18:30.440
I never scheme, but to relieve your worries.

18:39.039 --> 18:42.359
This game of chess is at a stalemate,
with both sides equally matched.

18:42.960 --> 18:44.440
You want me to lose?

18:44.440 --> 18:46.680
In some games, losing is winning.

18:46.680 --> 18:51.359
Don't you know what I'm best at
is breaking the stalemate?

18:51.359 --> 18:54.279
This move on the center point
is played brilliantly.

18:54.279 --> 18:56.559
Since Lord Xu likes to reason
and apply pressure

18:56.559 --> 18:57.960
[Laws of Ning Empire]
by using the Laws of Ning Empire.

18:57.960 --> 19:00.920
We can break this stalemate
by treating him with courtesy.

19:00.920 --> 19:04.519
Lord Xu has announced the abolition
of the Imperial Exam for Women.

19:04.519 --> 19:07.039
By now, I presume
many students are on their way home.

19:07.039 --> 19:10.400
Meng Ting Hui, I'd like to see

19:10.400 --> 19:13.119
if you can convince Lord Xu.

19:13.119 --> 19:16.359
I'm of little influence
and have no acquaintances in the capital.

19:17.759 --> 19:19.839
And I'm not your minister.

19:24.480 --> 19:27.880
Lord Gu can be of use.

19:28.704 --> 19:31.584
[Gu Mansion]

19:42.480 --> 19:44.880
Lord Gu, Madam invites you
to have dinner with her.

19:45.640 --> 19:49.440
I still have things to do. Let her eat first.

19:49.440 --> 19:52.799
Lord Gu, Madam cooked today.

19:52.799 --> 19:55.440
She has been busy preparing
a table of delicacies all day.

19:55.440 --> 19:57.400
Please come with me.

20:15.960 --> 20:17.319
Honey, you're here.

20:18.160 --> 20:21.319
This is a meal I specially prepared for you.

20:21.319 --> 20:23.960
I didn't expect
it would be so difficult to invite you.

20:31.039 --> 20:32.319
I have many affairs to handle recently.

20:33.279 --> 20:36.039
No matter how busy you are,
you must take care of yourself.

20:37.559 --> 20:40.519
Don't stay in the study tonight.

20:51.039 --> 20:54.000
With the Imperial Exam for Women abolished,
I need to deal with many issues.

20:54.640 --> 20:55.799
You should rest first.

20:55.799 --> 20:59.960
You're skipping the meal and sleep for work.
Is it all for Shen Zhi Li, isn't it?

21:00.680 --> 21:04.160
Well, it was wise of you
to have her enter the palace.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.720
She and His Majesty
used to be childhood sweethearts.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.640
If they spend day and night together,

21:08.640 --> 21:10.960
she might soon become the Empress.

21:12.839 --> 21:14.000
Nonsense!

21:14.000 --> 21:17.000
The emperor-minister affair warrants execution
of nine clans according to our ancestral precept.

21:17.799 --> 21:19.559
Are you trying to destroy the Shen family?

21:19.559 --> 21:22.119
Don't ever say that again.

21:22.119 --> 21:24.960
I am just planning for your sake.

21:24.960 --> 21:27.759
Shen Zhi Li is your most prized student.

21:27.759 --> 21:29.400
If she were to become the Empress,

21:29.400 --> 21:32.559
you could become the first chancellor
of Ning Empire sooner.

21:32.559 --> 21:36.359
His Majesty's marriage concerns the nation.
How could you make such remarks?

21:37.680 --> 21:39.160
It's strange.

21:39.160 --> 21:42.680
Every time Shen Zhi Li is mentioned,
you lose your composure like this.

21:44.400 --> 21:46.039
Le Yan is different from you.

21:46.039 --> 21:49.039
She has aspirations,
aiming to debate politics in the court.

21:50.039 --> 21:52.640
How could she be willing
to be confined to the harem?

21:52.640 --> 21:55.319
Are you despising me
for having no aspirations?

21:55.920 --> 21:57.640
What's the point of being female officials?

21:57.640 --> 21:59.640
Nowadays, all female officials
in the court hold sinecures.

21:59.640 --> 22:02.160
They all hope to resign
and marry someone decent.

22:02.160 --> 22:05.119
Is she never going
to marry in her entire life?

22:05.119 --> 22:07.319
Besides,
the one she would marry is His Majesty.

22:07.319 --> 22:09.240
What is there for you
to be dissatisfied with?

22:09.240 --> 22:12.680
It's not our place
to discuss how His Majesty thinks.

22:13.440 --> 22:15.440
If you have nothing to do,
go to the theater and watch a play.

22:16.480 --> 22:17.960
Mind your words.

22:25.119 --> 22:26.119
What kind of wine is this?

22:27.000 --> 22:30.160
This is the potent tonic wine
I had Dou Kou prepare.

22:33.440 --> 22:37.680
Honey, just stay here tonight.

22:54.079 --> 22:55.799
Look at him now.

22:55.799 --> 22:57.720
He's forgotten his own origins.

22:57.720 --> 22:59.079
How dare he scowl at me every day?

23:00.160 --> 23:02.200
Madam, please calm down.

23:03.039 --> 23:04.064
Pour the wine away.

23:04.680 --> 23:05.728
Yes.

23:25.824 --> 23:29.056
[Chunman House]

23:30.279 --> 23:32.880
Since Lord Xu forcibly abolished
the Imperial Exam for Women,

23:32.880 --> 23:35.359
female students from various prefectures
have gone to my residence.

23:35.960 --> 23:37.680
I have been refusing all invitations.

23:37.680 --> 23:40.039
And I only made an exception
to accept this invitation for you.

23:40.799 --> 23:42.559
I know you are in a difficult position.

23:42.559 --> 23:44.839
Today, I brought someone
to help share your burden.

23:58.359 --> 23:59.360
This is...

24:03.640 --> 24:06.160
I am Meng Ting Hui. Greetings, Lord Gu.

24:08.480 --> 24:12.039
Le Yan, I know you've been taking care
of Miss Meng in the palace recently.

24:12.039 --> 24:15.079
You brought her here
to discuss the Imperial Exam for Women, right?

24:15.079 --> 24:16.128
Exactly.

24:16.839 --> 24:17.960
Lord Gu,

24:18.759 --> 24:22.400
I have studied the Laws of Ning Empire for days
and figured out a solution,

24:22.400 --> 24:24.799
which can refute Lord Xu's memorial
to abolish the Imperial Exam for Women.

24:24.799 --> 24:26.519
However, we need your help.

24:26.519 --> 24:27.520
Absurd!

24:29.279 --> 24:32.960
Le Yan, I know you want
to restore the Imperial Exam for Women.

24:32.960 --> 24:34.279
Forgive me. I can't help.

24:34.279 --> 24:39.079
Master, I heard from my father
that you didn't sign Lord Xu's memorial.

24:39.079 --> 24:43.799
Since Lord Xu made up his mind,
whether I signed or not would change nothing.

24:43.799 --> 24:46.279
However,
I have made proper arrangements for you.

24:46.279 --> 24:48.039
Scholar Liu at the Hanlin Academy
is a close acquaintance of mine.

24:48.039 --> 24:50.359
You can go there to study.

24:50.359 --> 24:53.240
Master, I am taking the Imperial Exam,

24:53.240 --> 24:57.200
not to stay in the court
by relying on my origin or your influence.

24:57.200 --> 24:59.160
The Imperial Exam for Women
has been put on hold for nine years.

24:59.160 --> 25:01.880
If it's truly abolished,
there might be no chance to restore it.

25:02.599 --> 25:06.920
Women across the nation will see no future
and can only be trapped within their homes.

25:06.920 --> 25:09.200
If we can stop Lord Xu now,

25:09.200 --> 25:11.839
I am willing to try my best.
I hope you will help me.

25:12.519 --> 25:14.200
That doesn't sound like you.

25:20.079 --> 25:24.440
Meng Ting Hui, Lord Xu abolished
the Imperial Exam for Women because of you.

25:24.440 --> 25:27.400
Even His Majesty couldn't stop it.
What can we do then?

25:27.400 --> 25:29.279
After you entered the palace,
you drew criticism.

25:29.279 --> 25:31.119
Now you incite Le Yan
to submit a pledge of allegiance.

25:32.079 --> 25:34.359
If all women were to imitate you,

25:34.359 --> 25:36.640
seeking fame and clinging to the powerful,

25:36.640 --> 25:38.519
what would the court become?

25:38.519 --> 25:42.160
What makes you think
I would help you oppose Lord Xu?

25:42.160 --> 25:47.200
At court, the only one
who can stand up to Lord Xu is you, Lord Gu.

25:47.200 --> 25:49.920
But now, the Imperial Exam for Men
is controlled by Lord Xu.

25:49.920 --> 25:53.319
Even with your great achievements,
you are still suppressed by him.

25:53.319 --> 25:56.319
But if you are willing to stand up
for the women across the nation,

25:56.319 --> 26:00.400
in the future court, female officials
will surely be loyal to you.

26:00.400 --> 26:03.960
Lord Gu, why not listen to my plan
before making a decision?

26:03.960 --> 26:07.279
Master, please calm down.
Let's hear Miss Meng's plan first.

26:09.039 --> 26:11.000
The Recommendation System section
of the Laws of Ning Empire states

26:11.000 --> 26:12.599
that to ensure students excel
both academically and morally,

26:12.599 --> 26:14.599
they can be recommended by their hometowns
and mutually guarantee each other.

26:14.599 --> 26:17.119
If we gather recommendation letters
from Women's Academies across the nation,

26:17.119 --> 26:19.519
and then unite the female scholars
to submit a joint petition,

26:19.519 --> 26:21.319
requesting the restoration
of the Imperial Exam for Women

26:21.319 --> 26:23.759
to create a situation
where public opinion cannot be defied.

26:23.759 --> 26:27.359
At that point,
even if Lord Xu can oppose His Majesty,

26:27.359 --> 26:29.920
he cannot oppose all the students.

26:29.920 --> 26:33.319
If you've already planned it all out,
why do you need me?

26:33.319 --> 26:35.200
I can manage the joint petition,

26:36.400 --> 26:38.559
but as for the recommendation letters
from each prefecture,

26:38.559 --> 26:41.559
I am of little influence,
so I can't obtain them.

26:41.559 --> 26:44.680
If you are willing
to proclaim your support for the students,

26:44.680 --> 26:46.079
people would rally behind you in no time.

26:47.000 --> 26:49.680
Master, my father wrote this,

26:49.680 --> 26:50.920
proving this method is viable.

27:00.480 --> 27:02.039
It's been five days.

27:02.039 --> 27:05.599
Miss Meng said she'd get recommendation letters
from Women's Academies and come to us.

27:05.599 --> 27:08.200
But so far, we heard nothing from her.

27:10.119 --> 27:11.279
I'm afraid we wouldn't hear from her.

27:12.000 --> 27:15.519
The court has already announced the abolition
of the Imperial Exam for Women.

27:15.519 --> 27:18.039
Waiting any longer will just be futile.

27:18.680 --> 27:22.480
We've studied hard for years
and finally become scholars,

27:22.480 --> 27:24.680
but the court abolished
the Imperial Exam just like that.

27:24.680 --> 27:27.839
Do we women really have no chance
for the Imperial Exam?

27:41.160 --> 27:42.200
There's hope!

27:43.880 --> 27:44.960
There's hope for us!

27:45.920 --> 27:47.640
By proposing to increase
the allocation of school lands

27:47.640 --> 27:49.680
to benefit the Women's Academies
in every prefecture, Lord Gu obtained for us

27:49.680 --> 27:52.079
a joint recommendation letter
from all the prefectures.

27:52.079 --> 27:53.559
There's hope
for restoring the Imperial Exam for Women.

27:54.519 --> 27:56.440
Great!

27:56.440 --> 27:57.720
Finally, there's hope.

27:57.720 --> 27:59.680
Sign the joint petition now.

27:59.680 --> 28:04.160
Let's go to Lord Xu's residence to demand
the restoration of the Imperial Exam for Women.

28:04.160 --> 28:05.200
Yes!

28:05.200 --> 28:06.720
- I'll go too.
- Me too.

28:06.720 --> 28:09.504
I'll go too.

28:09.504 --> 28:12.440
[Xu Mansion]
We want the exam! We demand to see Lord Xu!

28:12.440 --> 28:15.799
We want the exam! We demand to see Lord Xu!

28:19.904 --> 28:21.472
[With literary and military talents,
women can rival any man]

28:23.240 --> 28:26.920
How dare you to cause a disturbance
at the Chancellor's residence!

28:26.920 --> 28:28.000
Drive them all away!

28:28.000 --> 28:29.000
Yes!

28:29.000 --> 28:31.559
We're just petitioning. What crime is it?

28:31.559 --> 28:32.880
What right do you have to drive us away?

28:32.880 --> 28:34.160
Don't fear, everyone.

28:34.160 --> 28:37.088
Anyone who unjustifiably harms a scholar
will be flogged 20 strokes and exiled for a year.

28:37.088 --> 28:38.160
We're not leaving!

28:38.160 --> 28:39.599
Lord Xu arrives.

28:39.599 --> 28:40.640
We're not leaving!

28:52.200 --> 28:53.440
Lord Xu,

28:54.359 --> 28:57.759
on behalf of all the female scholars
in the Ning Empire,

28:57.759 --> 29:01.400
we are here to petition
with recommendation letters and a joint petition.

29:05.359 --> 29:11.119
Meng Ting Hui, you caused the Huiyuan case
to be known throughout the city.

29:11.119 --> 29:13.759
Now you're inciting female scholars
to besiege my residence.

29:13.759 --> 29:15.680
This is outrageous!

29:15.680 --> 29:20.400
It seems it's right
to abolish the Imperial Exam for Women.

29:20.400 --> 29:22.039
Exam fraud has existed since ancient times.

29:22.759 --> 29:25.240
The perpetrators should be punished.

29:25.240 --> 29:28.119
Why would it block the path
to the career for women?

29:28.119 --> 29:29.680
I dare to ask,

29:29.680 --> 29:31.799
is this truly
for the long-term stability of the nation,

29:32.799 --> 29:35.279
or is it driven by your own selfish motives?

29:35.279 --> 29:36.519
Insolent!

29:36.519 --> 29:39.039
Since the late Emperor
allowed women to become officials,

29:39.039 --> 29:42.960
few female officials has been able
to serve a full term.

29:42.960 --> 29:47.400
They either resigned halfway for their family,
or proved unqualified for the task.

29:47.400 --> 29:49.880
That's why the Imperial Exam for Women
has been put on hold all along.

29:49.880 --> 29:52.480
You entered the harem as a commoner.

29:52.480 --> 29:54.799
Are you truly seeking to become an official,

29:55.799 --> 29:59.279
or trying to curry favor with His Majesty?

29:59.279 --> 30:02.640
Today, I am willing
to stake everything to prove my resolve.

30:11.359 --> 30:14.839
[Meng Ting Hui]
I sign this pledge with blood.

30:14.839 --> 30:17.880
If I fail the Palace Exam,
I am willing to be assigned to the Music Bureau.

30:21.279 --> 30:25.880
Lord Xu, will you restore
the Imperial Exam for Women,

30:25.880 --> 30:27.799
giving justice to the women
across the nation?

30:34.480 --> 30:39.440
Fine. If any of you dares to pledge this,

30:40.119 --> 30:43.359
I will believe you are sincere
about taking the exam.

30:50.799 --> 30:52.839
Why must you implicate others?

30:52.839 --> 30:54.039
In my view,

30:54.759 --> 31:00.000
you female scholars are all just bluffing
without qualifications.

31:00.000 --> 31:02.680
These women think highly of themselves,

31:02.680 --> 31:06.519
but at critical moments, they back down.
How can they bear great responsibilities?

31:18.039 --> 31:19.920
When I bid farewell to my families, I swore

31:20.559 --> 31:25.240
that I would either return home in glory,
or die in a foreign land.

31:28.720 --> 31:30.799
I will sign this pledge.

31:46.000 --> 31:47.759
Miss Meng, I...

31:49.200 --> 31:52.680
Miss Shen, you come from
a prominent family with many connections.

31:52.680 --> 31:56.599
No. I have blood phobia.

31:58.480 --> 32:00.680
This rouge can also prove your sincerity.

32:06.640 --> 32:09.039
Zhi Li comes from a prominent family,

32:09.680 --> 32:12.720
yet she is still willing
to fight for the future of women.

32:12.720 --> 32:13.720
I am in.

32:15.000 --> 32:16.720
Today, we are going all out.

32:16.720 --> 32:18.680
We must not let others look down on us.

32:18.680 --> 32:19.920
Exactly! We can't let them look down on us.

32:19.920 --> 32:21.240
- Yes.
- Exactly.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.559
I'll sign too.

32:22.559 --> 32:23.839
- I'll sign too.
- Me too.

32:23.839 --> 32:25.536
- I'll sign.
- Me too.

32:25.536 --> 32:26.640
Count me in.

32:26.640 --> 32:28.000
- Me too.
- I want to sign too.

32:28.000 --> 32:29.120
I'll sign too.

32:31.480 --> 32:33.599
- Me too.
- I want to sign too.

32:33.599 --> 32:35.200
And me.

32:35.200 --> 32:37.248
[I am willing to sign this pledge with blood]

32:37.248 --> 32:39.680
[If I fail the Palace Exam, I am willing
to be assigned to the Music Bureau. Meng Ting Hui]

32:45.680 --> 32:48.480
The tide turns, and the people follow.

32:49.240 --> 32:52.960
The Women's Academies and their students
have stated their position clearly.

32:54.480 --> 32:58.400
Please give us a chance
to fulfill our aspirations!

32:59.119 --> 33:03.480
Please give us a chance
to fulfill our aspirations!

33:14.039 --> 33:17.920
Fine. I shall wait and see.

33:19.599 --> 33:24.640
If there's any more trouble,
don't blame me for being merciless.

33:38.400 --> 33:39.552
Wonderful!

33:44.079 --> 33:45.240
Wonderful!

33:46.519 --> 33:47.640
Wonderful!

33:53.472 --> 33:54.784
Wonderful!

34:17.480 --> 34:19.480
You cast your eyes
upon the common folk every day.

34:19.480 --> 34:21.360
But have you ever
viewed the imperial city from here?

34:21.360 --> 34:23.199
If you hadn't invited me today,

34:23.199 --> 34:26.840
having grown up in the imperial palace,
I would've never known such a place.

34:29.079 --> 34:33.000
When you were in Shazhou,
you said freedom is a luxury.

34:33.000 --> 34:35.440
Now I know your true identity.

34:35.440 --> 34:38.800
He Du. "Du" stands for solitude.

34:38.800 --> 34:43.199
I think I understand that as an Emperor,
you can't have true freedom.

34:46.079 --> 34:49.559
<i>Son, do you know what "solitude" means?</i>

34:58.400 --> 35:00.360
The Book of Documents says,

35:00.360 --> 35:04.519
"When the ruler is virtuous,
the whole world follows."

35:04.519 --> 35:09.639
Thus, the Emperor's
solitude is not isolation,

35:10.400 --> 35:15.639
but the weight of the world
rests on your shoulders alone.

35:20.400 --> 35:22.559
Father, please take care of your health.

35:22.559 --> 35:25.199
I-I am afraid...

35:27.199 --> 35:30.199
What are you afraid of? Tell me.

35:30.840 --> 35:37.360
I'm afraid that when I inherit that throne,
I couldn't bear that weight of the world.

35:37.360 --> 35:40.920
I'm afraid of disappointing you and Mother.

35:40.920 --> 35:46.639
I'm even more afraid that from then on,
in this vast imperial palace,

35:46.639 --> 35:51.559
no one will ever love and cherish me
like you and Mother do.

35:51.559 --> 35:52.960
Look up.

35:54.199 --> 35:58.760
The Emperor may bleed or lose his head,

35:59.440 --> 36:01.519
but he must never show weakness.

36:04.039 --> 36:06.800
My son, remember.

36:07.440 --> 36:14.199
The Emperor's solitude means
you must give up your own feelings,

36:14.199 --> 36:18.440
to achieve the greatness for the world.

36:24.400 --> 36:27.719
I prepared the Shaosanbai wine
from Shazhou for you.

36:31.360 --> 36:32.960
After my father admonished me,

36:34.679 --> 36:38.079
I dared not slack off in the slightest.

36:38.079 --> 36:41.599
I haven't even
drunk a single drop of the wine.

36:41.599 --> 36:46.039
I think the late Emperor
gave you the name "Solitude",

36:46.039 --> 36:48.599
not wanting you to be alone all your life.

36:48.599 --> 36:50.920
It was simply
because you were his only child.

36:52.159 --> 36:55.679
No one else but you
are qualified to bear the bitterness,

36:56.400 --> 36:59.440
hardship, and solitude of the Emperor.

37:01.960 --> 37:06.960
You're right. Perhaps this was
my father's expectation of me.

37:08.119 --> 37:09.920
Then I shall break the rule today.

37:22.000 --> 37:25.159
Drinking atop the imperial city at this hour

37:25.159 --> 37:27.199
is a first in my life.

37:27.199 --> 37:32.199
Watching you drink atop the imperial city
is also a first in my life.

37:32.840 --> 37:37.159
You are the first person to make me willing
to break the rule and drink wine.

37:41.760 --> 37:44.840
There are things
even you cannot resolve overnight.

37:45.719 --> 37:48.519
But you can
drink to your heart's content today.

37:58.800 --> 38:00.440
I haven't felt so carefree in a long time.

38:02.480 --> 38:07.480
It seems every time I'm with you,
I can temporarily forget these worries.

38:09.400 --> 38:12.639
Your Majesty,
since my injuries are now fully healed,

38:13.639 --> 38:15.079
it's time for me to leave.

38:16.400 --> 38:17.880
You want to leave the imperial palace?

38:17.880 --> 38:20.079
If I stay in the palace,

38:20.079 --> 38:23.639
even if I rank first in the Palace Exam,
I fear it will still invite criticism.

38:23.639 --> 38:26.079
People might say you showed favoritism.

38:26.079 --> 38:27.200
Do you need it?

38:27.840 --> 38:29.480
I must succeed.

38:29.480 --> 38:30.639
So confident?

38:30.639 --> 38:32.079
Your Majesty,

38:32.079 --> 38:35.519
do you have any arrangement
for the top three candidates in the Palace Exam?

38:35.519 --> 38:39.599
You haven't even passed the exam yet.
How dare you inquire about the arrangement?

38:39.599 --> 38:41.840
If one must first hold the office
before discussing state affairs,

38:42.719 --> 38:47.239
then how did previous sages
earn good reputations for accepting advice?

38:47.239 --> 38:51.320
The Censorate has a special function,
so naturally capable people should fill it.

38:52.119 --> 38:54.039
I am willing to share your burdens.

38:54.039 --> 38:57.079
About the Censorate, it's still in discussion
and hasn't been announced yet.

38:57.079 --> 38:58.800
How did you learn of it?

38:58.800 --> 39:00.199
When passing by the Imperial Garden,

39:01.760 --> 39:04.719
I happened to overhear Grand Tutor Shen
discussing it with you.

39:04.719 --> 39:08.800
You restored the Imperial Exam for Women
precisely to break the old conventions, right?

39:08.800 --> 39:09.888
I boldly say,

39:10.639 --> 39:15.079
if I could be the top scholar, I am willing
to be the sharp sword in your hand.

39:19.639 --> 39:20.639
Meng Ting Hui,

39:22.360 --> 39:26.239
do you really think I will always
tolerate you for overstepping bounds?

39:26.239 --> 39:32.480
Remember, where the sword points
is decided only by the one who wields it.

39:44.448 --> 39:46.624
[Shen Mansion]

39:46.624 --> 39:48.599
Zhi Li, tell me.

39:48.599 --> 39:51.480
At the entrance of the Xu residence today,
did Lord Xu's beard bristle with rage??

39:52.119 --> 39:54.239
We were acting according to the law.

39:54.239 --> 39:56.719
Why do you make it sound like
a street performance?

39:56.719 --> 39:58.480
It's rare for Lord Xu
to make a fool of himself.

39:58.480 --> 40:00.599
I must know some details,
especially since you were there.

40:00.599 --> 40:02.199
- Tell me some details.
- I just remembered

40:02.199 --> 40:04.119
that unfinished game of chess
you left in the study.

40:04.119 --> 40:05.440
We can play chess anytime.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.719
Come on. I want to play now.

40:06.719 --> 40:07.880
- Let's go now.
- Don't...

40:07.880 --> 40:09.159
- Zhi Li!
- Let's go.

40:09.159 --> 40:10.960
Which way did his beard bristle?

40:10.960 --> 40:12.519
Zhi Li, rest well.

40:39.199 --> 40:42.400
Three slices of ginger.

40:46.440 --> 40:48.320
Three red dates.

40:53.320 --> 40:55.039
Three pieces of brown sugar.

41:12.960 --> 41:14.119
Zhi Li.

41:14.119 --> 41:15.200
Come in.

41:20.039 --> 41:22.320
Zhi Li, are you feeling better?

41:23.159 --> 41:24.288
I'm fine.

41:25.119 --> 41:27.719
Well, I heard from the maids

41:27.719 --> 41:30.400
that at this time of the year,
you should drink something to warm up.

41:42.480 --> 41:43.520
Careful, it's hot.

41:48.320 --> 41:49.344
How is it?

41:50.000 --> 41:51.880
Quite sweet. Thank you, Nian.

41:54.800 --> 41:57.800
Then rest well. I'm leaving.
